Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Library books for Owen Thadd, tier 10 (Friend of the Library). A running loop from the Undercity Magic Quarter through Silverpine, Orgrimmar, the Barrens, Ashenvale, Darkshore, Stonetalon, Stranglethorn, Duskwood, Westfall and Tirisfal. Flight points and the hearthstone are optional. About 2.5 hours. \\ Westfall's Sentinel Hill and Darkshore's Auberdine have Alliance guards: keep clear of them. Elwynn Forest is not on this route: do not take a shortcut through it. \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[GA Horde]
[N 18 Library Books Horde Tier 10]
[NX 38 Library Books Horde Tier 20]

Talk to Owen Thadd in the Magic Quarter and accept [QA78150 Friend of the Library] [G73.4,33.0 Undercity]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Undercity] flight path [G63.1,48.3 Undercity] (hub: flies to every Horde point in the Eastern Kingdoms)
Leave Undercity and follow the road west to Silverpine [G61.8,65 Tirisfal Glades][G49,70 Tirisfal Glades]
[OC]Optional: get the [P The Sepulcher] flight path [G45.6,42.4 Silverpine Forest]
Follow the Silverpine road south and loot *The Dalaran Digest, Vol. 23* at Ambermill, accept [QA78127] [G60,20 Silverpine Forest][G50,40 Silverpine Forest][G56,62 Silverpine Forest][G60,68 Silverpine Forest][G63.5,63.2 Silverpine Forest] \\ Son of Arugal (elite) can spawn at night in south Silverpine: run if you see him. Ambermill mobs reach your level and above: stick to the road.
Run back north to the Tirisfal zeppelin towers [G60,68 Silverpine Forest][G56,62 Silverpine Forest][G50,40 Silverpine Forest][G60,20 Silverpine Forest][G49,70 Tirisfal Glades][G61.8,65 Tirisfal Glades][G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades]

Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar [G51,13.9 Durotar]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Orgrimmar] flight path [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar] (hub: flies to every Horde point in Kalimdor)
Loot *The Lessons of Ta'zo* in the Cleft of Shadow, accept [QA79094] [G45.5,12 Durotar][G38.7,78.4 Orgrimmar]
Leave Orgrimmar and follow the road south-west to the Southfury bridge [G45.5,12 Durotar][G41,25 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Crossroads] flight path [G51.5,30.4 The Barrens]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Ratchet] flight path [G63.1,37.1 The Barrens] (neutral)
Cross into the Barrens, run north and loot *Arcanic Systems Manual*, accept [QA78145] [G61.8,20 The Barrens][G51,20 The Barrens][G56.3,8.8 The Barrens] \\ Razormane elites (Berserker, Flesheater, level 18-19) roam the north road: watch for them.
Run to Mor'shan Rampart and up into Ashenvale [G48,6 The Barrens][G68,86 Ashenvale]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Splintertree Post] flight path [G73.3,61.7 Ashenvale]
Follow the Ashenvale road west, around the west side of Astranaar, and north to Darkshore [G58,55 Ashenvale][G39,61 Ashenvale][G29,50 Ashenvale][G27,36 Ashenvale][G28,14 Ashenvale] \\ Ashenvale mobs reach level 25+: stick to the road. Astranaar has Alliance guards: keep clear of it.
Follow the Darkshore road north and loot *Nar'thalas Almanac, Vol. 74*, accept [QA78124] [G43,92 Darkshore][G44,76 Darkshore][G44,58 Darkshore][G41,40 Darkshore][G46,30 Darkshore][G52,25 Darkshore][G59.6,22.2 Darkshore] \\ Stay east of Auberdine and its Alliance guards. Baron Marinous and Lady Vespira walk the coast nearby: keep your distance.
Run back south to Ashenvale [G52,25 Darkshore][G46,30 Darkshore][G41,40 Darkshore][G44,58 Darkshore][G44,76 Darkshore][G43,92 Darkshore]
Follow the Ashenvale road south to the Talondeep Path entrance [G28,14 Ashenvale][G27,36 Ashenvale][G29,50 Ashenvale][G39,61 Ashenvale][G42.5,71 Ashenvale]
Go through Talondeep Path and down the east side of Stonetalon, loot *Fury of the Land*, accept [QA78149] [G78,42 Stonetalon Mountains][G79.5,60 Stonetalon Mountains][G84.2,72 Stonetalon Mountains][G81,78.5 Stonetalon Mountains][G74.4,85.7 Stonetalon Mountains] \\ Stonetalon mobs are above your level, Grimtotem camps lie off the road: stick to the road.
[OC]Optional: get the [P Sun Rock Retreat] flight path [G45.2,59.9 Stonetalon Mountains] (west of the road through enemy-level mobs; skip unless you want it)
Run through the pass into the Barrens [G82,96 Stonetalon Mountains]
Loot *Secrets of the Dreamers* at the Wailing Caverns mouth, accept [QA78143] [G35.5,27.5 The Barrens][G43,31 The Barrens][G49.3,32.9 The Barrens] \\ Deviate elites (15-17) guard the cave mouth: pull them one at a time or bring a friend.
Loot *Baxtan: On Destructive Magics*, accept [QA79097] [G52,30 The Barrens][G59,34 The Barrens][G62.7,36.3 The Barrens] \\ Bruuz (elite, 20) patrols near the book.
Run to the Ratchet dock [G63.8,38.8 The Barrens]

Take the boat to Booty Bay [G25.7,73.1 Stranglethorn Vale]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Booty Bay] flight path [G26.8,77.0 Stranglethorn Vale]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Grom'gol] flight path [G32.5,29.3 Stranglethorn Vale]
Follow the Stranglethorn road north past Grom'gol into Duskwood [G38,50 Stranglethorn Vale][G31.5,29.1 Stranglethorn Vale][G38,4 Stranglethorn Vale] \\ Stranglethorn mobs are far above your level: stick to the road.
Follow the Duskwood road west past Raven Hill to Westfall [G45,70 Duskwood][G20,48 Duskwood] \\ Duskwood mobs are above your level: stick to the road. Mor'Ladim (elite) walks the Raven Hill Cemetery north of the road: keep your distance.
Loot *Rumi of Gnomeregan: The Collected Works* just south of Sentinel Hill, accept [QA79093] [G68,70 Westfall][G52,62 Westfall][G52.7,53.8 Westfall] \\ Sentinel Hill has Alliance guards: come in from the south, loot and leave. Vultros (elite) flies over central Westfall: watch for him.
Loot *Bewitchments and Glamours* in the Dagger Hills, accept [QA78142] [G52,62 Westfall][G45.4,70.4 Westfall] \\ Foe Reaper 4000 (elite) walks the fields near 44,35 and Leprithus (elite) rises at night near 42,29: watch for them.
Run back east through Duskwood to Grom'gol [G52,62 Westfall][G68,70 Westfall][G20,48 Duskwood][G45,70 Duskwood][G38,4 Stranglethorn Vale][G31.5,29.1 Stranglethorn Vale] \\ Optional: if your hearthstone is set in Undercity or Brill, hearth now [H] and skip the zeppelin.
Take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades [G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades]

Loot *The Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer* in Brill, accept [QA79095] [G59.4,52.3 Tirisfal Glades]
Run back into Undercity [G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades][G61.8,65 Tirisfal Glades]
Turn in at Owen Thadd: [QT78127] [QT79094] [QT78145] [QT78124] [QT78149] [QT78143] [QT79097] [QT79093] [QT78142] [QT79095] and [QT78150 Friend of the Library] [G73.4,33.0 Undercity]
]], 'DungeonQuests - JanRK')
